{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2135a6335974a7bded3be516954402bc2c04a20b2fd60b536cd06281a2588d3e", "ja": "おっと、それは気をつけないとな。\nけど、気に入ってくれたようで良かったよ。", "zh": "哎呀，那可得小心点才行。  \n不过，看起来你很喜欢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "f6f4248e2303e37f2d6d2f0e81f59c7bd0a979a1c1aba9c99507ca3ff4433db0", "ja": "うん！　なんか、キラキラーって感じ！\nせくしーぷりちーガールの亜美に、ピッタリンコだね♪", "zh": "嗯！感觉就是闪闪发光的那种！和性感可爱女孩亚美超合拍呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "1e8ac26d24c0f25afd3faa7c7cedb84344a6929cf67012d2dbb7e8b015409b23", "ja": "でねでね、兄ちゃん！　亜美、この衣装に合う、\nめちゃ盛り上がるステージ演出を思いついたんだ～。", "zh": "而且啊而且啊，哥哥！亚美想到了超适合这套服装、能让现场嗨起来的舞台演出～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6b7207db62194e28c6c0bff21b35fa9eb904fcb0b0a95d0c14581137f3792aa0", "ja": "その衣装に合う……。\nシャボン玉でも使うとか？", "zh": "适合那套服装的……要不要用泡泡之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "241e586f26ddc2cc88b5cdefd96a2ab503414794c46607a9500bfa7cd5622cc2", "ja": "おおっ！　なんでわかったの！？　兄ちゃんって、\n実はエスパー？　そうそう、シャボン玉をね……。", "zh": "哦哦！你怎么知道的！？哥哥你其实是超能力者？对对，就是要用肥皂泡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0514_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "1b6c036907fe9d6f9acf42af99c1ca59668151b2626b2354b498a0ec927329d1", "ja": "あらゆる方向から、客席いーっぱいに飛ばしまくるの！\nみんなで泡まみれになったら、チョー楽しいっしょ♪", "zh": "从四面八方，朝着观众席吹得满满当当的！\n要是大家身上都沾满泡泡，肯定超好玩的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
